    "detailed_description": "<strong>Half Built: Casino</strong> is the new casino tycoon game from Short Olive Games. Build your dream casino. Do it yourself or hire a crew of builders to help you out.<br><br>Build your favorite games. Slots, Pokers, Craps, Blackjack, roulette, and more to come. Hire Dealers to help you succeed. <br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1907990/extras/0f018188609476e54726227d64f04de2.avif?t=1710735221\" /></div><br><br><br>Provide services to your guests. Keep their stomachs full and their bladders empty. Provide guests drinks to help increase bet size. <br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1907990/extras/b7c6f528f087e84e9e9cafc43cf5718a.avif?t=1710735221\" /></div><br><br>Take loans from the mob to keep growing but don't miss a payment! Miss too many payments and they will come after you!<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1907990/extras/b82fc741c2b16143060783eabf7ff29e.avif?t=1710735221\" /></div><br><br>Hire Entertainers and build a stage. Shows will bring extra guests who will stick around and try their luck.<br><br>Too much money on hand? Build a vault to keep it all stored. Watch out for thieves! <br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1907990/extras/ea5afeed786cb91047569ffc6f457027.avif?t=1710735221\" /></div><br><br>Research new items and unlock new options.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1907990/extras/db43515668106b1b1b6018d6a2cc7863.avif?t=1710735221\" /></div><br><br>Join us now in Early Access and watch the game grow and have your say on potential new content.<br><br>A world-class legitimate enterprise or a seedy backroom game room? The choice is yours with Half Built: Casino!",
